# Only the owner merges changes of CI, ownership, deployment and secrets: tier T0 of asome-platform's
# policies/dev.yaml (the dispatcher never enables auto-merge for them, the ruleset `code-owners`
# requires the code owner's review; the owner's own PRs merge with an admin bypass of that ruleset
# only). Keep in step with policies/dev.yaml (tests/unit/test_f5_templates.py).
/.github/ @jochanan-ai/owners
/CODEOWNERS @jochanan-ai/owners
/docs/CODEOWNERS @jochanan-ai/owners
/.gitmodules @jochanan-ai/owners
/deploy/ @jochanan-ai/owners
/infra/ @jochanan-ai/owners
/SECURITY.md @jochanan-ai/owners
/docs/security/ @jochanan-ai/owners
/secrets/ @jochanan-ai/owners
/.env @jochanan-ai/owners
/.env.* @jochanan-ai/owners
*.pem @jochanan-ai/owners
*.key @jochanan-ai/owners
*.p12 @jochanan-ai/owners
*.jks @jochanan-ai/owners
